WEBVTT

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:36.870 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 33]

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.120 line:0%
It's the first time

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.640 line:0%
I've heard someone singing nursery rhymes in a graveyard.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.240 line:0%
On this dark and windy night,

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.240 line:0%
it's quite intriguing.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.760 line:0%
Oh, it's you.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.520 line:0%
You're the one who saved me.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.520 line:0%
You can just treat me

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.850 line:0%
as a mysterious person,

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.560 line:0%
Ghost Face.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.320 line:0%
Or as a friend.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.480 line:0%
Secretary Lu,

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.480 line:0%
you came to the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.270 line:0%
and yet you're leaving

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.070 line:0%
without even saying hello to me?

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:14.840 line:0%
Lai Luozhi

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.200 line:0%
did so many bad things.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.850 line:0%
That must have been a disguise.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.760 line:0%
Perhaps

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.270 line:0%
his approach to me

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.040 line:0%
was also part of some scheme.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.200 line:0%
Excuse me.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.040 line:0%
Make way, please.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
Coming through!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.740 line:0%
Nerd Jiang!

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.379 line:0%
Thank you, sir.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:24.760 line:0%
Here.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:26.880 line:0%
Have a taste.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.280 line:0%
Try it.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.959 line:0%
What are you up to?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.400 line:0%
Why are you following me?

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.490 line:0%
To... To protect you.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.640 line:0%
Protect me?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.200 line:0%
How long have you been following me?

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.260 line:0%
Not... Not long.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:01.910 line:0%
So this is why

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.400 line:0%
recently, it's always been Yun Que

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.060 line:0%
who's by Commander Xu's side.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:06.560 line:0%
It's because you've been spending

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:07.700 line:0%
all your time following me, right?

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.800 line:0%
Not entirely.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:09.600 line:0%
Yun Que...

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.640 line:0%
You idiot.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.000 line:0%
That's your boss.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.440 line:0%
Why are you following me?

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.980 line:0%
I'm worried you might encounter danger.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.959 line:0%
Then why didn't you just tell me?

00:05:48.959 --> 00:05:50.800 line:0%
Why act like a thief?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.180 line:0%
You wouldn't have agreed.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.120 line:0%
Sir.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.360 line:0%
How much?

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.500 line:0%
I've already paid.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:03.920 line:0%
You

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.800 line:0%
are still the same as when you were a child,

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.320 line:0%
always eager to throw gold ingots around,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.640 line:0%
without considering if it's worth it.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:09.440 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.080 line:0%
I, Lu Chuichui,

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.520 line:0%
am always meticulous with money

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.120 line:0%
and never spend recklessly.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:19.130 line:0%
How do you know things about my childhood?

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.600 line:0%
You're blushing.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:24.720 line:0%
Why are you blushing?

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:26.580 line:0%
You haven't even had any wontons.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:40.600 line:0%
Come with me.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.600 line:0%
This... This...

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.920 line:0%
Such a huge gold ingot.

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:15.560 line:0%
When did you

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.960 line:0%
become so rich?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:41.920 line:0%
A man shouldn't spend

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.600 line:0%
his whole life serving others.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.640 line:0%
You should do something more meaningful

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.040 line:0%
and protect more people.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.600 line:0%
Lady Lu.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.000 line:0%
Lady Lu.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.440 line:0%
I'm yours from now on.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:02.720 line:0%
From now on,

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.280 line:0%
I am yours.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.520 line:0%
It's you?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:28.080 line:0%
That poor boy who had to sell himself?

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:37.830 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.120 line:0%
I've listened to you.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.000 line:0%
I've tried my best to help

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.680 line:0%
many, many, many people.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.200 line:0%
From the moment you gave me this gold ingot,

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.260 line:0%
I, Jiang Langxing,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.300 line:0%
have been yours, Lu Chuichui.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:21.960 line:0%
Sister.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.070 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:53.340 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.680 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.760 line:0%
I've heard that you've

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.000 line:0%
never been fond of attending such banquets, Grand Commander Shen.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.040 line:0%
I didn't expect you

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.480 line:0%
to bring Mrs. Shen along to my banquet today.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.480 line:0%
This truly delights me to no end.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:11.330 line:0%
Even Grand Commander Shen has arrived.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:10.970 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.040 line:0%
Why is Lord Lai, who's equal in fame to White Ghost,

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.160 line:0%
still nowhere to be seen?

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.320 line:0%
I, Lai, am late.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.040 line:0%
It looks like it's about to snow.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.500 line:0%
I wonder if my elder sister may have the honor

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.360 line:0%
to join Princess Ying and the ladies

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.090 line:0%
in admiring the snow together?

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.160 line:0%
Sister.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:55.920 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.040 line:0%
that you'd bring your esteemed sister here, Lord Lai.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.400 line:0%
It truly honors me.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:02.640 line:0%
I, Luofu, arrived late.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.120 line:0%
Please forgive me, everyone.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.720 line:0%
Why don't you all take a seat?

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.120 line:0%
I will personally

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.400 line:0%
pour wine for everyone as an apology.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.200 line:0%
Very well.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.600 line:0%
Please be seated.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.060 line:0%
[Wine]

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.720 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.710 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.410 line:0%
Apologies for my rudeness.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.070 line:0%
She looks so agile,

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:17.960 line:0%
not at all like

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.620 line:0%
someone who has been injured.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.560 line:0%
Could it be that in Gannan Area,

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.820 line:0%
you really mistook someone else for her?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.480 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.840 line:0%
I've heard that you're not only pretty, but also very talented, Mrs. Shen.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.080 line:0%
Why don't you dance for us

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.610 line:0%
to liven up the atmosphere?

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.400 line:0%
That's indeed true.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.560 line:0%
It's rare for Mrs. Shen to attend a banquet like this.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.360 line:0%
So naturally, she should give Prince Xian some face.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.120 line:0%
I believe she's not become arrogant

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.320 line:0%
just because she's now favored by

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.080 line:0%
Her Majesty.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.520 line:0%
Don't you agree?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.440 line:0%
Yes. Indeed.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.660 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.980 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.520 line:0%
I remember when you were petitioning for

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.790 line:0%
the marriage between the Shen and Yan families in front of Her Majesty,

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.840 line:0%
you said the Yan family had a daughter

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:40.180 line:0%
who's skilled in writing, singing, calligraphy, and dancing,

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.370 line:0%
with a reputation as a virtuous lady,

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.870 line:0%
unmatched in Xiang'an.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.780 line:0%
We should indeed take this opportunity

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.920 line:0%
to let everyone here

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.120 line:0%
see her talent.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.760 line:0%
I have also heard

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.720 line:0%
that Mrs. Shen once amazed the entire audience

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.450 line:0%
with a pipa dance

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.120 line:0%
at the Kaiyang Festival.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.160 line:0%
I wonder if you could

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.760 line:0%
perform a new piece

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.360 line:0%
here at my Mansion?

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.240 line:0%
Dr. Yan must have taught his daughter

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:11.160 line:0%
all six types of arts.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:13.720 line:0%
Why not entertain us all?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.720 line:0%
Today, my wife...

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.480 line:0%
Honey.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.590 line:0%
Since you insist,

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.280 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, shall entertain you all.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.360 line:0%
Honey,

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.930 line:0%
may I borrow your sword?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.340 line:0%
Fortunately, I've been secretly observing

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.270 line:0%
when Shen Du practices his swordsmanship every day.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:45.800 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:46.360 line:0%
Isn't your sister

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.520 line:0%
supposed to be a sheltered lady?

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:49.240 line:0%
How could she have

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.370 line:0%
such formidable martial arts skills?

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.520 line:0%
Her figure and technique...

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.080 line:0%
Why does it look somewhat familiar?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:01.960 line:0%
It seems like

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.220 line:0%
I've seen it somewhere before.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.950 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.330 line:0%
Sorry for having offended you.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.670 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.630 line:0%
Xing's swordsmanship is not refined,

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:30.880 line:0%
and she accidentally offended your sister.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.270 line:0%
Fortunately, your sister

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:34.200 line:0%
has profound martial arts skills.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.240 line:0%
She exchanged a few moves with me,

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:41.400 line:0%
which I believe shouldn't be considered a disruption to the elegance of the banquet.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.500 line:0%
It's no matter.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:54.680 line:0%
Splendid.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.500 line:0%
Splendid indeed.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:57.760 line:0%
Mrs. Shen and

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.400 line:0%
Lord Lai's sister's

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.890 line:0%
swordplay was truly magnificent.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:02.890 line:0%
It was a feast for my eyes.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:06.960 line:0%
How disgraceful.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.610 line:0%
You'd better go back and tidy yourself up.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.720 line:0%
You were too bold just now.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.520 line:0%
But it worked, didn't it?

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.700 line:0%
I believe you've found a definite answer to

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.500 line:0%
the doubts in your heart, right?

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.450 line:0%
The one I encountered in Gannan Area

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.720 line:0%
was indeed Lai Luofu.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.240 line:0%
Honey.

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:44.480 line:0%
It might look easy,

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:46.720 line:0%
but the sword was so heavy to swing.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.360 line:0%
I almost

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:51.560 line:0%
dropped it on the ground several times.

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.880 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you're pretty and talented,

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.560 line:0%
and you share such a romantic relationship with Grand Commander Shen.

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:06.160 line:0%
It's truly enviable.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:13.440 line:0%
The swordplay by Grand Commander and his wife

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.560 line:0%
was indeed eye-opening.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.320 line:0%
However, the piece

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.920 line:0%
Musician Jin just played...

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.040 line:0%
seems unfamiliar to me.

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:31.920 line:0%
I composed this new piece

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.000 line:0%
to celebrate the Winter Solstice.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.660 line:0%
It's called "Joy and Sorrow."

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:37.760 line:0%
Musician Jin

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.560 line:0%
is Mother's favorite musician.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.760 line:0%
It's extremely difficult to hear him perform on ordinary days.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.680 line:0%
I didn't expect that on Prince Xian's banquet today,

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:48.140 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:47.140 line:0%
not only did he managed to invite Musician Jin here

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.280 line:0%
to perform for us,

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.000 line:0%
but he'd also compose a new piece for us.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.490 line:0%
It's truly enviable.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.080 line:0%
I didn't expect that

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.560 line:0%
we'd hear

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.490 line:0%
Musician Jin's new composition at today's banquet, either.

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:01.550 line:0%
It's indeed an unexpected pleasure.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.920 line:0%
The cold weather portends snow.

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.400 line:0%
At such an elegant banquet,

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.520 line:0%
ladies and gentlemen,

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:12.480 line:0%
let's raise our glasses together

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.850 line:0%
and thank Prince Xian for his invitation.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.370 line:0%
[Elegant Residence]

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:40.930 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:44.760 line:0%
Help me!

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:48.340 line:0%
It hurts! It hurts so much!

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.710 line:0%
Help me, please!

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.440 line:0%
You were injured by Shen Du in Gannan Area.

00:21:57.360 --> 00:22:00.000 line:0%
I spent a fortune to find the miraculous medicine from the Western Regions

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.560 line:0%
to temporarily suppress

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:02.640 line:0%
your wounds,

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.240 line:0%
allowing you to appear as if you were perfectly well

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:07.870 line:0%
and attend the banquet to prove your innocence today.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:09.640 line:0%
But you recklessly showed your bravado

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:10.640 line:0%
and exposed yourself!

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.570 line:0%
Still not admitting your mistake?

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:15.420 line:0%
I want to kill Shen Du!

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:25.010 line:0%
You're now wounded on top of your previous injuries,

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:27.470 line:0%
and you've aroused everyone's suspicions.

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:29.260 line:0%
For now,

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:33.080 line:0%
you can't show your face in public anymore.

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:37.810 line:0%
No. No!

00:22:38.740 --> 00:22:39.680 line:0%
No.

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:41.110 line:0%
Give me some time.

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:42.610 line:0%
Give me a little more time.

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:43.720 line:0%
I'll...

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:45.640 line:0%
I'll recover in no time.

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:46.600 line:0%
Recover?

00:22:46.620 --> 00:22:47.520 line:0%
And make others suspect

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:49.780 line:0%
that you impersonated Chen Huo'e again?

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.070 line:0%
Trust me.

00:22:55.570 --> 00:22:56.720 line:0%
I'm still useful.

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:58.500 line:0%
I'm still of use.

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:00.120 line:0%
I still need to play the role

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.320 line:0%
of your elder sister, right?

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:03.400 line:0%
Give me some time.

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:04.300 line:0%
Trust me.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.790 line:0%
I'll recover.

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.410 line:0%
I'll be obedient.

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:08.640 line:0%
Help me!

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:10.220 line:0%
I'm still useful!

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:22.330 line:0%
Help me, please.

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:25.210 line:0%
It hurts so much!

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:29.360 line:0%
Please help me!

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:16.060 line:0%
Today is the Winter Solstice, but it hasn't snowed.

00:24:17.430 --> 00:24:18.320 line:0%
Are you planning

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:20.120 line:0%
to turn yourself into a snowman?

00:24:27.030 --> 00:24:29.050 line:0%
I plan to make dumplings for you.

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:32.590 line:0%
Making dumplings. Look.

00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:40.720 line:0%
Madam.

00:24:41.960 --> 00:24:44.400 line:0%
The palace eunuchs are here again.

00:24:45.200 --> 00:24:47.660 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has summoned you.

00:24:49.040 --> 00:24:50.720 line:0%
Now you're going to the palace

00:24:50.780 --> 00:24:52.180 line:0%
even more often than I do.

00:24:53.070 --> 00:24:53.880 line:0%
Got it.

00:24:53.960 --> 00:24:55.690 line:0%
I'll go get changed right away.

00:24:56.840 --> 00:24:59.500 line:0%
I'll finish cooking them for you after I return.

00:25:03.120 --> 00:25:03.920 line:0%
I'm off.

00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:21.400 line:0%
Your Majesty, this humble servant pays respects to you.

00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:22.200 line:0%
You may rise.

00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:23.720 line:0%
Come closer,

00:25:24.040 --> 00:25:24.800 line:0%
Ms. Yan.

00:25:25.170 --> 00:25:26.570 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:25:34.080 --> 00:25:35.880 line:0%
It's the Winter Solstice today.

00:25:35.880 --> 00:25:38.410 line:0%
I've let all others go celebrate the festival

00:25:38.560 --> 00:25:41.160 line:0%
and only snatched you to keep me company.

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:44.720 line:0%
Mr. Shen won't blame me, will he?

00:25:45.560 --> 00:25:47.280 line:0%
You must be joking, Your Majesty.

00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:47.960 line:0%
Come here.

00:25:48.160 --> 00:25:49.120 line:0%
Sit down.

00:25:57.240 --> 00:25:58.430 line:0%
I heard that

00:25:58.920 --> 00:26:01.220 line:0%
yesterday, Mr. Lai

00:26:01.320 --> 00:26:02.480 line:0%
also played a joke

00:26:02.480 --> 00:26:04.080 line:0%
on Mr. Shen, didn't he?

00:26:05.360 --> 00:26:06.160 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:08.400 --> 00:26:09.310 line:0%
The two of them

00:26:09.360 --> 00:26:11.280 line:0%
are my right-hand men.

00:26:12.280 --> 00:26:14.280 line:0%
You should advise Mr. Shen

00:26:14.680 --> 00:26:15.800 line:0%
not to have any misunderstandings

00:26:15.800 --> 00:26:17.440 line:0%
with Lai Luozhi.

00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:20.360 line:0%
It would be best if the matter ends here.

00:26:21.860 --> 00:26:24.590 line:0%
I'm grateful for the your concern, Your Majesty.

00:26:24.600 --> 00:26:27.240 line:0%
Although I don't know the details,

00:26:27.520 --> 00:26:28.400 line:0%
my husband

00:26:28.400 --> 00:26:29.280 line:0%
has been serving you

00:26:29.280 --> 00:26:30.920 line:0%
wholeheartedly, Your Majesty.

00:26:30.920 --> 00:26:32.040 line:0%
Surely, he won't harbor

00:26:32.040 --> 00:26:33.840 line:0%
any biased or selfish thoughts.

00:26:38.080 --> 00:26:40.600 line:0%
It's about time for snow.

00:26:42.640 --> 00:26:44.300 line:0%
The year-end is approaching,

00:26:46.840 --> 00:26:49.200 line:0%
and I've aged another year.

00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:53.520 line:0%
May you live for thousands of years, Your Majesty.

00:26:54.600 --> 00:26:55.840 line:0%
That's not necessary.

00:26:55.840 --> 00:26:58.160 line:0%
Sit down. Sit down.

00:27:03.360 --> 00:27:04.560 line:0%
Today,

00:27:04.680 --> 00:27:06.720 line:0%
there's no one else in the palace.

00:27:07.120 --> 00:27:08.920 line:0%
There's no need to be so formal.

00:27:09.800 --> 00:27:12.000 line:0%
I am just

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:13.580 line:0%
a mortal being.

00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:16.440 line:0%
How could I live for thousands of years?

00:27:18.200 --> 00:27:20.600 line:0%
They respect me,

00:27:21.720 --> 00:27:23.360 line:0%
and fear me even more.

00:27:24.880 --> 00:27:27.440 line:0%
Because in this vast palace,

00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:29.960 line:0%
there is no one

00:27:30.880 --> 00:27:33.280 line:0%
who can stand shoulder to shoulder with me.

00:27:34.680 --> 00:27:37.240 line:0%
I see that Lord Baohuan

00:27:37.960 --> 00:27:39.240 line:0%
and Madam Xu

00:27:39.880 --> 00:27:42.680 line:0%
both treat you with utmost respect, Your Majesty.

00:27:44.200 --> 00:27:46.800 line:0%
That's because of the favor I've granted them.

00:27:47.000 --> 00:27:48.120 line:0%
You still have

00:27:48.240 --> 00:27:49.640 line:0%
Princess Yong'an

00:27:49.720 --> 00:27:51.200 line:0%
and Prince Xian, Your Majesty.

00:27:51.200 --> 00:27:51.880 line:0%
They are both

00:27:51.880 --> 00:27:53.540 line:0%
your children, Your Majesty.

00:28:03.600 --> 00:28:04.520 line:0%
They

00:28:05.640 --> 00:28:07.720 line:0%
are only eagerly eyeing

00:28:08.840 --> 00:28:10.100 line:0%
the position beside Qi,

00:28:10.100 --> 00:28:12.480 line:0%
that future position of Regent.

00:28:13.160 --> 00:28:15.280 line:0%
They're hoping for me to age quickly,

00:28:15.760 --> 00:28:17.760 line:0%
so they can grasp power.

00:28:18.610 --> 00:28:19.880 line:0%
How could they still remember

00:28:19.880 --> 00:28:21.960 line:0%
their duties as children?

00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:26.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:28:27.560 --> 00:28:29.020 line:0%
Let's not talk about them.

00:28:29.320 --> 00:28:30.960 line:0%
I summoned you here today

00:28:31.480 --> 00:28:32.240 line:0%
because I heard

00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:36.160 line:0%
how protective Mr. Shen is of you.

00:28:39.780 --> 00:28:43.580 line:0%
It suddenly reminded me of my days with the late emperor.

00:28:44.720 --> 00:28:47.920 line:0%
He was also protective of me like that.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:50.440 line:0%
He was always a person

00:28:50.640 --> 00:28:52.640 line:0%
who'd avoid conflicts with others,

00:28:53.120 --> 00:28:54.760 line:0%
but for my sake,

00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:58.280 line:0%
he would stand against the entire court.

00:29:08.480 --> 00:29:10.200 line:0%
I'm truly getting old.

00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:12.280 line:0%
Old indeed.

00:29:14.520 --> 00:29:15.640 line:0%
Lately,

00:29:18.440 --> 00:29:21.280 line:0%
I've been really fond of reminiscing.

00:29:24.280 --> 00:29:25.120 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:29:28.900 --> 00:29:31.130 line:0%
Mr. Shen's love for you

00:29:31.850 --> 00:29:34.050 line:0%
is pure and genuine.

00:29:34.750 --> 00:29:37.520 line:0%
It even makes my previous arrangement of your marriage

00:29:37.520 --> 00:29:39.800 line:0%
seem a bit insensitive.

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:43.170 line:0%
You're too kind, Your Majesty.

00:29:44.570 --> 00:29:45.760 line:0%
In Shen Du's heart,

00:29:45.760 --> 00:29:47.640 line:0%
you hold a very important place.

00:29:48.400 --> 00:29:50.260 line:0%
It's exactly because of this that

00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:53.080 line:0%
I want to advise you

00:29:54.400 --> 00:29:57.120 line:0%
not to let dark clouds obscure your judgment.

00:29:58.560 --> 00:30:00.840 line:0%
No matter the time or circumstances,

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:06.200 line:0%
cherish your loved one.

00:30:13.080 --> 00:30:14.410 line:0%
I'll bear it in mind, Your Majesty.

00:30:14.410 --> 00:30:22.420 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:30:27.920 --> 00:30:28.720 line:0%
Si.

00:30:32.320 --> 00:30:33.000 line:0%
Master asked you

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.360 line:0%
to return to the Yan's Mansion immediately.

00:30:34.360 --> 00:30:35.120 line:0%
Father?

00:30:36.080 --> 00:30:36.720 line:0%
Now?

00:30:36.720 --> 00:30:37.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:30:37.200 --> 00:30:38.730 line:0%
Please get in the carriage.

00:30:43.180 --> 00:30:45.280 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:30:48.930 --> 00:30:51.170 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:31:06.560 --> 00:31:07.500 line:0%
Xing.

00:31:08.110 --> 00:31:09.310 line:0%
Come here, come here.

00:31:11.350 --> 00:31:14.070 line:0%
Minister Zhang has a few questions for you.

00:31:14.920 --> 00:31:15.920 line:0%
You two talk.

00:31:31.360 --> 00:31:32.290 line:0%
Minister Zhang.

00:31:32.920 --> 00:31:33.680 line:0%
We just met yesterday

00:31:33.680 --> 00:31:35.500 line:0%
at the banquet in Prince Xian's Mansion.

00:31:35.500 --> 00:31:36.800 line:0%
May I ask why you

00:31:36.800 --> 00:31:38.240 line:0%
have specially come to the Yan's Mansion

00:31:38.240 --> 00:31:39.200 line:0%
to see me today?

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:41.480 line:0%
I heard that you've been

00:31:41.480 --> 00:31:44.210 line:0%
repeatedly summoned to the palace lately, Xing.

00:31:44.920 --> 00:31:47.380 line:0%
You seem to be in high favor with Her Majesty.

00:31:48.400 --> 00:31:50.000 line:0%
Minister Zhang, you flatter me.

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:50.880 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:31:50.880 --> 00:31:52.200 line:0%
just wanted to

00:31:52.240 --> 00:31:54.440 line:0%
have some casual conversation with me.

00:32:02.640 --> 00:32:06.360 line:0%
To be able to have casual conversations with the Grand Empress Dowager

00:32:06.360 --> 00:32:07.200 line:0%
is a blessing that many people

00:32:07.200 --> 00:32:09.460 line:0%
couldn't achieve in several lifetimes.

00:32:10.560 --> 00:32:12.360 line:0%
You've been by Shen Du's side

00:32:12.360 --> 00:32:13.690 line:0%
through life and death,

00:32:13.850 --> 00:32:17.050 line:0%
and now you've gained the Grand Empress Dowager's favor.

00:32:17.390 --> 00:32:19.310 line:0%
It's truly remarkable.

00:32:20.320 --> 00:32:22.480 line:0%
Now that you're riding high on success, Xing,

00:32:22.480 --> 00:32:23.680 line:0%
do you still remember

00:32:23.940 --> 00:32:26.100 line:0%
why you were arranged to marry Shen Du?

00:32:39.900 --> 00:32:41.120 line:0%
Today is the Winter Solstice.

00:32:41.120 --> 00:32:43.040 line:0%
I won't beat around the bush with you.

00:32:43.040 --> 00:32:44.240 line:0%
Just tell me what

00:32:44.240 --> 00:32:45.600 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager discussed with you,

00:32:45.600 --> 00:32:46.680 line:0%
and what has happened

00:32:46.680 --> 00:32:48.480 line:0%
in the Shen family recently.

00:32:48.730 --> 00:32:50.960 line:0%
Tell me everything in detail.

00:32:56.240 --> 00:32:58.500 line:0%
I don't know anything, Your Excellency.

00:33:00.480 --> 00:33:02.380 line:0%
Are you trying to rebel?

00:33:04.410 --> 00:33:06.520 line:0%
Minister Zhang, you've been using my father and the Yan family

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:08.160 line:0%
to control me for a long time.

00:33:08.580 --> 00:33:10.200 line:0%
I did indeed marry into the Shen family

00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:11.640 line:0%
in place of my third sister, Caiwei.

00:33:11.640 --> 00:33:12.560 line:0%
However, I

00:33:12.600 --> 00:33:14.480 line:0%
have been solely focused on handling cases in the Ministry of Justice

00:33:14.480 --> 00:33:16.680 line:0%
and easing the burdens of the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:33:16.680 --> 00:33:18.680 line:0%
I know nothing else,

00:33:18.680 --> 00:33:20.480 line:0%
and I cannot know anything else.

00:33:20.720 --> 00:33:22.780 line:0%
I beg for your mercy, Minister Zhang.

00:33:23.920 --> 00:33:24.950 line:0%
Xing.

00:33:25.360 --> 00:33:26.400 line:0%
Do you think that having gained

00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:29.080 line:0%
the favor of the Grand Empress Dowager and Shen Du,

00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:30.540 line:0%
you can act with impunity?

00:33:30.640 --> 00:33:32.100 line:0%
Do you think I can no longer

00:33:32.720 --> 00:33:34.040 line:0%
control you

00:33:34.800 --> 00:33:36.240 line:0%
and the Yan family?

00:33:40.750 --> 00:33:42.810 line:0%
Royal favor can change in an instant,

00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:44.960 line:0%
and Shen Du can barely protect himself.

00:33:44.960 --> 00:33:47.600 line:0%
Yet you believe he can protect you

00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:49.840 line:0%
and your Yan family?

00:33:51.600 --> 00:33:53.200 line:0%
I don't want to rely on anyone.

00:33:53.200 --> 00:33:54.440 line:0%
I only want to rely on myself.

00:33:54.440 --> 00:33:55.240 line:0%
Good.

00:33:56.350 --> 00:33:57.480 line:0%
You've grown bold,

00:33:57.480 --> 00:33:58.210 line:0%
haven't you?

00:34:00.920 --> 00:34:01.720 line:0%
This time,

00:34:02.320 --> 00:34:03.520 line:0%
I accompanied my husband

00:34:03.520 --> 00:34:05.080 line:0%
to Gannan Area

00:34:05.600 --> 00:34:07.120 line:0%
to investigate the Half-faced Ghosts

00:34:07.120 --> 00:34:08.680 line:0%
and the Fire Moth Sect along the way.

00:34:08.680 --> 00:34:11.140 line:0%
We gained many insights about the frontier,

00:34:11.600 --> 00:34:13.050 line:0%
and we also uncovered

00:34:13.160 --> 00:34:14.280 line:0%
many unexpected stories

00:34:14.280 --> 00:34:15.610 line:0%
by following the clues.

00:34:18.030 --> 00:34:19.240 line:0%
I wonder if you'd be

00:34:19.280 --> 00:34:22.010 line:0%
interested in hearing about it, Minister Zhang?

00:34:25.209 --> 00:34:26.470 line:0%
What do you want to say?

00:34:26.490 --> 00:34:27.510 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:34:27.769 --> 00:34:29.700 line:0%
Don't you spread baseless rumors.

00:34:29.800 --> 00:34:31.370 line:0%
Since you don't want to hear it, Minister Zhang,

00:34:31.370 --> 00:34:32.880 line:0%
I won't speak of it.

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:36.110 line:0%
However, during my review

00:34:36.200 --> 00:34:37.950 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice's files today,

00:34:37.950 --> 00:34:39.479 line:0%
a question arose in my mind.

00:34:43.880 --> 00:34:45.800 line:0%
Regarding the old case of the Shen family,

00:34:45.800 --> 00:34:48.550 line:0%
why didn't you submit a single memorial

00:34:49.080 --> 00:34:52.140 line:0%
and take no stance on such a major case, Minister Zhang?

00:34:52.720 --> 00:34:53.510 line:0%
Publicly,

00:34:53.720 --> 00:34:56.510 line:0%
you were already a pillar of the court at that time.

00:34:56.510 --> 00:34:57.320 line:0%
Privately,

00:34:58.590 --> 00:35:00.040 line:0%
weren't you

00:35:00.040 --> 00:35:02.840 line:0%
a classmate of Lord Shen Bingzhu, Minister Zhang?

00:35:04.640 --> 00:35:05.900 line:0%
What are you implying?

00:35:06.560 --> 00:35:08.040 line:0%
What exactly do you know?

00:35:09.640 --> 00:35:11.280 line:0%
I don't know anything specific,

00:35:11.280 --> 00:35:13.040 line:0%
nor do I know what I should know.

00:35:14.000 --> 00:35:15.440 line:0%
You have no evidence,

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:17.580 line:0%
yet you're trying to threaten me?

00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:24.160 line:0%
If you have any questions, Minister Zhang,

00:35:24.160 --> 00:35:26.010 line:0%
just come to the Shen's Mansion and ask me directly.

00:35:26.010 --> 00:35:27.360 line:0%
Coming out of your way

00:35:27.800 --> 00:35:29.930 line:0%
to the Yan's Mansion to trouble my wife

00:35:30.280 --> 00:35:32.210 line:0%
is quite inappropriate, isn't it?

00:35:34.840 --> 00:35:35.720 line:0%
I originally thought

00:35:35.720 --> 00:35:37.760 line:0%
that you were an upright official in the court, Minister Zhang,

00:35:37.760 --> 00:35:40.090 line:0%
above the dirty dealings of officialdom.

00:35:44.320 --> 00:35:45.280 line:0%
But now, how have you stooped to

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:47.240 line:0%
threatening a woman?

00:35:51.920 --> 00:35:52.720 line:0%
Goodbye.

00:36:21.400 --> 00:36:22.480 line:0%
Xing.

00:36:25.560 --> 00:36:26.360 line:0%
Mother.

00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:28.720 line:0%
Caiwei, Yijiao, Mojie.

00:36:29.010 --> 00:36:30.410 line:0%
Why are you all out here?

00:36:40.520 --> 00:36:41.320 line:0%
Here.

00:36:55.400 --> 00:36:56.760 line:0%
That old fool, your father.

00:36:56.760 --> 00:36:57.720 line:0%
He's spineless

00:36:57.760 --> 00:36:59.200 line:0%
and only knows how to harm his daughter.

00:36:59.200 --> 00:37:00.280 line:0%
You came back on the Winter Solstice,

00:37:00.280 --> 00:37:02.320 line:0%
yet you left without even having a meal.

00:37:02.320 --> 00:37:03.000 line:0%
I know

00:37:03.000 --> 00:37:05.000 line:0%
you must feel wronged inside.

00:37:07.080 --> 00:37:08.080 line:0%
Right.

00:37:08.360 --> 00:37:10.400 line:0%
Mother and Ms. Jin made glutinous rice and date cakes and dumplings

00:37:10.400 --> 00:37:12.000 line:0%
for you and Brother-in-law.

00:37:12.520 --> 00:37:13.720 line:0%
They'd been waiting for you to come back

00:37:13.720 --> 00:37:15.680 line:0%
and reheated them several times already.

00:37:15.680 --> 00:37:17.560 line:0%
Then they heard you had left.

00:37:18.040 --> 00:37:20.500 line:0%
Ms. Jin got so anxious that she almost cried.

00:37:21.640 --> 00:37:22.440 line:0%
Mother.

00:37:22.940 --> 00:37:24.000 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:37:24.080 --> 00:37:25.680 line:0%
Why should you apologize?

00:37:25.760 --> 00:37:27.420 line:0%
It's all your father's fault.

00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:31.160 line:0%
Haven't you always

00:37:31.160 --> 00:37:33.420 line:0%
loved eating this since you were little?

00:37:39.840 --> 00:37:40.760 line:0%
Eat up, Xing.

00:37:40.760 --> 00:37:41.720 line:0%
It's still warm.

00:37:42.920 --> 00:37:43.840 line:0%
Thank you, Yijiao.

00:37:43.840 --> 00:37:44.840 line:0%
Thank you, Mojie.

00:37:44.880 --> 00:37:45.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:37:46.200 --> 00:37:48.800 line:0%
How have you been at the Shen's Mansion lately?

00:37:49.160 --> 00:37:50.560 line:0%
Everything's been good.

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:51.640 line:0%
That's good.

00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:53.320 line:0%
The other day, I heard Father,

00:37:53.320 --> 00:37:55.000 line:0%
Mo Jie and Shiyuan talking.

00:37:55.280 --> 00:37:56.520 line:0%
I heard that the Grand Empress Dowager

00:37:56.520 --> 00:37:57.720 line:0%
favored Lai Luozhi

00:37:57.880 --> 00:37:59.400 line:0%
and suppressed Grand Commander Shen,

00:37:59.400 --> 00:38:00.880 line:0%
but to maintain a balance, seemingly,

00:38:00.880 --> 00:38:02.440 line:0%
she's been summoning you to the palace daily to accompany her.

00:38:02.440 --> 00:38:04.040 line:0%
It's not that serious.

00:38:04.880 --> 00:38:05.680 line:0%
Xing.

00:38:06.600 --> 00:38:08.000 line:0%
Like I said before,

00:38:08.920 --> 00:38:10.400 line:0%
if you and that White Ghost

00:38:10.400 --> 00:38:11.960 line:0%
could live harmoniously as husband and wife

00:38:11.960 --> 00:38:13.280 line:0%
and live happily together,

00:38:13.280 --> 00:38:14.880 line:0%
of course that would be good.

00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:17.160 line:0%
But if you had to live

00:38:17.160 --> 00:38:18.560 line:0%
with your neck on the knife's edge every day,

00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:20.360 line:0%
constantly worrying all the time,

00:38:20.360 --> 00:38:22.160 line:0%
then you might as well come home.

00:38:22.360 --> 00:38:23.200 line:0%
No matter what,

00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:26.060 line:0%
there's always a place for you at the Yan's Mansion.

00:38:27.080 --> 00:38:27.880 line:0%
That's right.

00:38:28.000 --> 00:38:29.560 line:0%
Ms. Jin might have been a bit blunt,

00:38:29.560 --> 00:38:31.220 line:0%
but it's all for your own good.

00:38:31.280 --> 00:38:32.200 line:0%
No matter what,

00:38:32.200 --> 00:38:33.600 line:0%
your happiness is the most important thing.

00:38:33.600 --> 00:38:34.760 line:0%
Please don't make any more sacrifices

00:38:34.760 --> 00:38:36.040 line:0%
for the Yan family.

00:38:41.080 --> 00:38:42.140 line:0%
Thank you, Mother,

00:38:42.240 --> 00:38:43.200 line:0%
and brothers and sisters

00:38:43.200 --> 00:38:44.240 line:0%
for your concern.

00:38:44.560 --> 00:38:45.640 line:0%
I'm doing well now.

00:38:46.120 --> 00:38:47.040 line:0%
Really well.

00:39:01.680 --> 00:39:03.320 line:0%
Then we can rest assured.

00:39:05.200 --> 00:39:06.000 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:39:06.080 --> 00:39:07.280 line:0%
Today is the Winter Solstice holiday.

00:39:07.280 --> 00:39:08.280 line:0%
It's rare for us to have some time off.

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:09.000 line:0%
Why don't we

00:39:09.000 --> 00:39:11.260 line:0%
go take a stroll in the streets together?

00:39:22.040 --> 00:39:23.400 line:0%
He doesn't eat people.

00:39:28.120 --> 00:39:29.200 line:0%
Then let's... Go?

00:39:54.680 --> 00:39:57.280 line:0%
Your family members all care for you very much.

00:39:59.360 --> 00:40:01.700 line:0%
The Yan household is peaceful.

00:40:02.310 --> 00:40:04.440 line:0%
Although there are occasional disputes,

00:40:04.440 --> 00:40:06.800 line:0%
most of them come from good intentions.

00:40:08.160 --> 00:40:09.250 line:0%
I wonder

00:40:09.960 --> 00:40:12.200 line:0%
if this is my father's blessing

00:40:13.200 --> 00:40:13.840 line:0%
or

00:40:13.840 --> 00:40:15.440 line:0%
the blessing of us siblings.

00:40:16.800 --> 00:40:17.960 line:0%
It's my blessing.

00:40:22.660 --> 00:40:24.320 line:0%
My parents passed away early.

00:40:25.430 --> 00:40:26.470 line:0%
What I envy most

00:40:27.720 --> 00:40:29.280 line:0%
is a complete family.

00:40:31.810 --> 00:40:32.720 line:0%
Actually, since the first time

00:40:32.720 --> 00:40:35.380 line:0%
I went to the Yan's Mansion, I've been wondering

00:40:35.960 --> 00:40:37.480 line:0%
why you would aspire

00:40:38.320 --> 00:40:40.180 line:0%
to clear the wronged of the world.

00:40:41.400 --> 00:40:44.460 line:0%
It turns out you've been happy and healthy since childhood,

00:40:44.460 --> 00:40:46.560 line:0%
with a pure sense of justice in your heart,

00:40:46.560 --> 00:40:48.160 line:0%
without a trace of impurity.

00:40:48.960 --> 00:40:50.040 line:0%
From now on,

00:40:51.480 --> 00:40:53.080 line:0%
they will all be your family.

00:41:15.520 --> 00:41:16.320 line:0%
Honey.

00:41:20.760 --> 00:41:21.560 line:0%
Be careful.

00:41:29.800 --> 00:41:32.440 line:0%
I didn't expect the Grand Commander who strikes fear into everyone's hearts

00:41:32.440 --> 00:41:33.440 line:0%
to be so tender-hearted

00:41:33.440 --> 00:41:35.280 line:0%
in front of his beloved wife.

00:41:40.630 --> 00:41:41.800 line:0%
Why are you here with

00:41:41.800 --> 00:41:42.720 line:0%
a constable?

00:41:45.200 --> 00:41:46.000 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:41:46.120 --> 00:41:47.080 line:0%
Don't you know that Lu Chuichui

00:41:47.080 --> 00:41:47.920 line:0%
is going to marry

00:41:47.920 --> 00:41:49.180 line:0%
one of our constables?

00:41:51.090 --> 00:41:52.460 line:0%
Don't talk nonsense.

00:41:52.960 --> 00:41:54.420 line:0%
You and Jiang Langxing...

00:41:55.040 --> 00:41:56.370 line:0%
You two are a couple now?

00:42:02.170 --> 00:42:03.800 line:0%
Go ahead and laugh at me all you want.

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:05.240 line:0%
Why would I laugh at you?

00:42:05.240 --> 00:42:06.600 line:0%
I'm happy for you.

00:42:07.680 --> 00:42:09.280 line:0%
You've finally come to your senses.

00:42:09.280 --> 00:42:10.280 line:0%
How did you discover

00:42:10.280 --> 00:42:12.200 line:0%
that Jiang Langxing had feelings for you?

00:42:12.200 --> 00:42:13.000 line:0%
I...

00:42:14.040 --> 00:42:15.170 line:0%
What was the reason?

00:42:16.240 --> 00:42:17.500 line:0%
Of course it's because

00:42:17.510 --> 00:42:18.640 line:0%
you're beautiful and kind-hearted,

00:42:18.640 --> 00:42:20.530 line:0%
and exceptionally intelligent.

00:42:24.920 --> 00:42:26.160 line:0%
Oh, you're blushing.

00:42:26.200 --> 00:42:26.920 line:0%
I also wanted to ask you

00:42:26.920 --> 00:42:28.400 line:0%
when you plan to hold the wedding banquet.

00:42:28.400 --> 00:42:30.360 line:0%
I want to get married on the same day as you.

00:42:30.360 --> 00:42:31.680 line:0%
You're getting married too?

00:42:31.680 --> 00:42:32.880 line:0%
Who are you marrying?

00:42:33.080 --> 00:42:33.920 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:42:33.960 --> 00:42:34.840 line:0%
Have you gone silly

00:42:34.840 --> 00:42:36.120 line:0%
from investigating the cases?

00:42:36.120 --> 00:42:37.400 line:0%
Can't you see?

00:42:37.520 --> 00:42:39.650 line:0%
Of course, I'm marrying Commander Xu.

00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:42.060 line:0%
Congratulations.

00:42:43.040 --> 00:42:43.840 line:0%
Thanks a lot.

00:42:44.240 --> 00:42:45.040 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:42:45.040 --> 00:42:46.600 line:0%
I'm already over you.

00:42:46.600 --> 00:42:47.200 line:0%
So, from now on,

00:42:47.200 --> 00:42:48.640 line:0%
you must treat Xing well.

00:42:48.640 --> 00:42:50.280 line:0%
If you scare Xing away,

00:42:50.280 --> 00:42:51.640 line:0%
I'm afraid no other woman in this world will like you.

00:42:51.640 --> 00:42:53.480 line:0%
Then you won't be able to find another wife.

00:42:53.480 --> 00:42:54.360 line:0%
So what?

00:42:54.800 --> 00:42:55.840 line:0%
In this life,

00:42:56.360 --> 00:42:57.760 line:0%
I'm content with only having Yan Xing as my wife.